      "title": "Owner-supplied Balatas Road canopy reference",
      "note": "Inspected 2026-10-02. User requests mature canopies covering the road from Magsaysay Avenue to the Minor Basilica. Trees are sampled at roughly 20 m on both verges, with estimated 19–22 m crowns and 8 m illustrative height. Trunks avoid full mapped road/path widths, standing roofs, water and existing tree centers; canopy overhang over roads is intentional. Gaps remain at constrained frontages and junctions. This is a schematic corridor, not a tree inventory, species identification or dated survey."
